# No internal/ packages

Never create or import a directory named `internal/` in this repo. Organize with ordinary sibling packages (`obs/tools`, `obs/session`, `lib/logger`).

Do not use Go's `internal/` visibility trick to hide code. If something must not be imported by other servers, keep it unexported in the owning package, or accept that sibling packages are importable.

```go
// ❌ BAD
obs/internal/session

// ✅ GOOD
obs/session
```
